@startuml
title Governed MCP Runtime Image Selection — Validated

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Pinned Dockerfile" as DF
component "build-mcpo-filesystem.bash" as BUILD
artifact "omelas/mcpo-filesystem:beta\nmutable build tag" as TAG
artifact "Validated image\nsha256:2a55c88be63c..." as IMG
component "mcpo.bash / resume-mcpo.bash" as RUN
component "Omelas-MCP-RW\n127.0.0.1:8765 -> 8000" as C
component "Authenticated OpenAPI\nsecure-filesystem-server\n0.2.0" as API
artifact "MCP_API_KEY\nlocal MCPO bearer token" as KEY
artifact "OPENAI_API_KEY\nseparate provider credential" as OAI

DF --> BUILD
BUILD --> TAG : MCP_MCPO_BUILD_IMAGE
TAG --> IMG : validated build result
IMG --> RUN : MCP_MCPO_RUNTIME_IMAGE
RUN --> C : governed restart
KEY --> RUN : --api-key
KEY --> API : Authorization: Bearer
C --> API
OAI -[hidden]-> KEY

note right of BUILD
Build precedence:
1. MCP_MCPO_BUILD_IMAGE
2. MCP_MCPO_IMAGE (deprecated)
3. :beta
end note

note right of RUN
Runtime precedence:
1. MCP_MCPO_RUNTIME_IMAGE
2. MCP_MCPO_IMAGE (deprecated)
3. validated immutable digest
end note

note bottom of KEY
Credential provenance correction:
MCP_API_KEY is a local MCPO token.
It must not reuse OPENAI_API_KEY.
end note
@enduml
